  [Node0.box, Node1.box, Node2.box, Node3.box, Node4.box, Node5.box, Node6.box, Node7.box,
   Node8.box, Node9.box, Node10.box, Node11.box]

/-- **The certificate**: the polyhedron of Lean's points is not Rupert. -/
